WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.382
all the customers were gone, Ray handed Ally a sandwich.

2
00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:24.204
"Who's this for?"

3
00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:25.065
she asked.

4
00:00:25.085 --> 00:00:27.326
"You," Ray said.

5
00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:31.288
"You're not earning much money—the least I can do is feed you."

6
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:35.010
"Thanks!" Ally took a bite.

7
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:41.296
"Delicious!" Ray sighed.

8
00:00:41.316 --> 00:00:44.559
"Glad someone likes my food."

9
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.482
Just then a boy around Ally's age walked in.

10
00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:54.528
Ally was about to hand him a menu, but the boy smiled.

11
00:00:54.548 --> 00:00:56.490
"I'm not a customer.

12
00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.672
I'm Mateo, Ray's son."

13
00:01:02.284 --> 00:01:02.704
"Hi, I'm Ally.

14
00:01:03.165 --> 00:01:03.985
I work here now."

15
00:01:04.005 --> 00:01:06.908
"Welcome to Ray's," Mateo said.

16
00:01:06.928 --> 00:01:09.790
"Hey, Papi, how was business today?"

17
00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:13.053
"Not so good," Ray replied.

18
00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.095
"Ally and I worked hard with just two of us.

19
00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:19.298
But that new place in town is stealing all my customers."

20
00:01:21.619 --> 00:01:25.342
"People are just going to Pepe's because it's new," Mateo said.

21
00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:35.004
"Good food should be what people care about," Ray muttered, as he went into the storeroom.

22
00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:39.448
"He's right," Mateo said.

23
00:01:39.468 --> 00:01:42.190
"And I bet our food is better than Pepe's."

24
00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:48.655
"The humans at Ray's are definitely better," Ally thought.

25
00:01:49.196 --> 00:01:51.778
Suddenly she spotted something familiar on Mateo's T-shirt.

26
00:01:51.798 --> 00:01:56.442
"Hey! Is that the OmegaDZed15 spaceship?"

27
00:01:57.743 --> 00:01:58.544
Mateo shrugged.

28
00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:02.162
"It's a model ship from the UFO museum.

29
00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.043
What's the OmegaDZed whatever?

30
00:02:05.864 --> 00:02:08.205
I'm a space geek, but I've never heard of that."

31
00:02:08.225 --> 00:02:11.467
"It's the Galorpians' star cruiser.

32
00:02:11.747 --> 00:02:12.948
They're a—" "Ally!"

33
00:02:13.608 --> 00:02:15.649
Ray came out of the storeroom to tell her something.

34
00:02:15.669 --> 00:02:18.991
"I'm going to close up early.

35
00:02:20.032 --> 00:02:22.053
I'll understand if you don't want to come back tomorrow."

36
00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:23.934
She blinked.

37
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.416
"Did I do something wrong?"

38
00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.341
"Not at all," Ray said.

39
00:02:31.361 --> 00:02:34.982
"But with so few customers, you couldn't have made much money today."

40
00:02:36.843 --> 00:02:38.424
Ally had already counted her tips.

41
00:02:38.444 --> 00:02:42.266
"Is fifty dollars a lot?"

42
00:02:42.286 --> 00:02:47.368
"Actually, that's not bad for a slow day," Mateo said.

43
00:02:47.388 --> 00:02:49.849
"The customers must have liked you."

44
00:02:54.251 --> 00:02:55.272
on, time to go home."

45
00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:01.246
Ray turned out the lights and led the way out of the diner.

46
00:03:03.988 --> 00:03:07.690
Ally left the humans and returned to her ship, which was still hidden in the park.

47
00:03:12.754 --> 00:03:22.860
Once she was back inside, she slipped off her meld The computer whirred to life as she sat

48
00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:28.024
down. "Scanning area, finding no new parts or fuel.

49
00:03:28.392 --> 00:03:35.438
Report." need to earn more money," Ally said.

50
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:39.302
"Calculate how much I need on this planet for new parts and fuel."

51
00:03:40.183 --> 00:03:41.103
The computer clicked.

52
00:03:41.123 --> 00:03:46.148
"Calculating $668.00."

53
00:03:46.508 --> 00:03:48.410
Ally sighed.

54
00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:51.993
"It's going to take longer than I expected.

55
00:03:52.013 --> 00:03:55.056
But that's okay," she added, thinking of Ray.

56
00:03:55.676 --> 00:03:58.680
"Astralians are supposed to do lots of good deeds.

57
00:03:59.621 --> 00:04:03.905
Helping Ray will give me practice for real Astralian missions."

58
00:04:03.925 --> 00:04:06.228
"Repeat warning!"

59
00:04:06.768 --> 00:04:08.470
The computer's lights flashed red.

60
00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:11.794
"Earthlings can be aggressive to beings from other planets!

61
00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:13.516
Use maximum caution!"

62
00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:34.681
When Ally arrived at the diner the next day, Ray and Mateo were eating breakfast.

63
00:04:34.701 --> 00:04:38.542
"You came back."

64
00:04:39.162 --> 00:04:40.303
Ray sounded surprised.

65
00:04:40.323 --> 00:04:42.783
"Of course," Ally said.

66
00:04:42.803 --> 00:04:46.484
"You sure you don't want me to stay and help today, Papi?"

67
00:04:46.844 --> 00:04:47.625
Mateo asked.

68
00:04:48.745 --> 00:04:49.645
Ray shook his head.

69
00:04:49.665 --> 00:04:51.486
"Ally's here.

70
00:04:52.066 --> 00:04:53.286
Go have fun at soccer camp."

71
00:04:59.128 --> 00:05:03.243
Mateo got up to leave, but he sat back down when two girls about his age walked in.

72
00:05:03.263 --> 00:05:09.988
"Two bagels to go," one said without looking up from the comm device in her hand.

73
00:05:13.031 --> 00:05:17.655
While Ally got their order ready, she noticed Mateo and the other girl smiling shyly at each other.

74
00:05:19.116 --> 00:05:20.597
"Hmm," she thought.

75
00:05:20.617 --> 00:05:25.362
"Interesting." Was there an opportunity here for another good deed?

76
00:05:26.062 --> 00:05:27.864
Ally quickly tucked her hair behind her ear.

77
00:05:34.432 --> 00:05:37.195
Then, as soon as the girls were gone, she turned to Mateo.

78
00:05:37.215 --> 00:05:39.296
"Do you know them?"

79
00:05:40.998 --> 00:05:41.538
"Sort of.

80
00:05:42.219 --> 00:05:47.403
The one with the phone is Kate, and the cute one is Bethany."

81
00:05:47.664 --> 00:05:48.424
Mateo blushed.

82
00:05:48.444 --> 00:05:52.528
"Well, Bethany thinks you're cute too!"

83
00:05:53.469 --> 00:05:54.249
Mateo laughed.

84
00:05:54.269 --> 00:05:56.431
"She does not!"

85
00:05:56.451 --> 00:05:58.333
"She does!"

86
00:05:58.793 --> 00:05:59.514
Ally insisted.

87
00:05:59.534 --> 00:06:01.575
"I'm sure of it!"

88
00:06:05.556 --> 00:06:09.138
Mateo got a dreamy look on his face and seemed to float out of the diner.

89
00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.062
just made Mateo very happy!"

90
00:06:15.462 --> 00:06:15.982
Ally thought.

91
00:06:16.863 --> 00:06:20.145
Her parents might not think it was a big deal, but she felt very pleased.

92
00:06:23.366 --> 00:06:24.687
Just then a customer walked in.

93
00:06:27.809 --> 00:06:30.531
She wore big glasses and had a beauty mark on her cheek.

94
00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:32.712
Ally hurried over.

95
00:06:39.052 --> 00:06:40.333
"What do you recommend?"

96
00:06:40.773 --> 00:06:41.453
the woman asked.

97
00:06:41.474 --> 00:06:47.417
"Ray's club sandwich is the best one in the universe," Ally replied.

98
00:06:47.437 --> 00:06:51.039
"Even better than the ones on Formaria12."

99
00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.000
The woman looked confused.

100
00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.883
"Formaria12? Where's that restaurant?"

101
00:06:56.903 --> 00:07:00.505
"Uh Ally gulped.

102
00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:02.746
"Nowhere. What would you like?"

103
00:07:03.907 --> 00:07:05.968
The woman peered at Ally and then shrugged.

104
00:07:07.836 --> 00:07:12.803
"Well, if you say the sandwich is that good, then that's what I'll have."

105
00:07:12.823 --> 00:07:17.389
"Phew!" Ally thought and hurried off to the kitchen.

106
00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.472
That had been a close call!
